OL,3,GNEWSADriving over potholes 'like being
OL,4,Aon a choppy sea'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of driving instructors says the
OL,7,Fstate of the roads in their town makes
OL,8,Fdriving feel like "being on a ship in
OL,9,Fchoppy seas".
OL,11,FThe Oswestry and District Driving
OL,12,FInstructors' Association (ODDIA) said
OL,13,Fpotholes, worn-down give-way markings
OL,14,Fand blind junctions were putting
OL,15,Flearners and the public at risk.
OL,17,FThe group of 27 instructors have filed
OL,18,Fa complaint with Shropshire Council
OL,19,Fabout the state of the area's roads.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
