OL,3,GNEWSADriving over potholes 'like being
OL,4,Aon a choppy sea'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeather Kidd, leader of the Liberal
OL,7,FDemocrat-run authority, said it had
OL,8,F"inherited years and years of
OL,9,Funderinvestment", adding that dealing
OL,10,F"with 3,200 miles of road and everybody
OL,11,Fcomplaining is very difficult".
